  "definition_bindings": {
    "zh": {
      "definition_file": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1218-n97-rigid-rod-affected-repair/zh/lesson.template.json",
        "bytes": 27144,
        "file_sha256": "15004a3cd21dcb279a7d0ccf3ff4b0bc9a7616f300b05a51e3d1ff475c774364",
        "canonical_sha256": "fda0e9a21b368a76962c0a833def1728c68b2bfe0de85e8a01a520c94c5a4da8"
      },
      "selected_definitions": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "entry_sha256": "b28a27307439a1b2ff5e33ac839776c30a4e1854bfedc26366a9b80960ffdd2f",
          "literal_text": "参考系 $K$ 与棒有相对运动，相对速度为 $v$。\n硬质棒在惯性参考系 $K_1$ 中静止，如图 223 所示。\n在 $K_1$ 中测得的棒长称为静长，也叫固有长度，记为 $l_0$。"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "entry_sha256": "ea3af8ee5efcc1e19211b98acbabf20a038c1868bca8827d21a384e918eb4dce",
          "literal_text": "在参考系 $K$ 中测量运动棒时，必须按这个参考系的同步钟同时记录棒的两端位置。\n两端位置之间的距离就是这个参考系测得的棒长 $l$。\n它与静长的关系为："
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "entry_sha256": "de2e03fa671756c693f72f5846bd8c048d6f0f38d4d094f5ae472399bbc6a7c8",
          "literal_text": "$l=l_0\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}$ (8.2)"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "entry_sha256": "fac1977348415a5db428430c48ed861e25285ef2bea6d2532696e990daa3c06f",
          "literal_text": "当相对速度非零且小于光速时，收缩因子满足：\n$\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}<1$"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "entry_sha256": "4b7bce0d0e22373c166c99b175e6f0aabf1ed3364291714fae16e7c0e0765900",
          "literal_text": "因此，沿相对运动方向测得的运动棒长度小于同一根棒的静长。\n垂直于相对运动方向的尺寸不发生这种长度收缩。\n相对速度为零时，测得的长度等于静长。"
        }
      ],
      "selected_projection_sha256": "e571ac551df0c7af80f200fad4572e3b88dd049f5b61c799ebbec872a98ee64a"
    },
    "en": {
      "definition_file": {
        "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1218-n97-rigid-rod-affected-repair/en/lesson.template.json",
        "bytes": 27985,
        "file_sha256": "4033bc45572426d1c21925779c768811d1239dac7e3948a11efeca9ce961eb09",
        "canonical_sha256": "585678fdbff0eb62881b077b50c06ed6a47ae38e4f1d2a0fed2494e6f8adff84"
      },
      "selected_definitions": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "entry_sha256": "9f7fc0de3427e6131a58ee01e53077460affd9120d8efff50a8fa9b5b5119fdd",
          "literal_text": "Frame $K$ moves relative to the rod at speed $v$.\nThe rigid rod is at rest in inertial frame $K_1$, as shown in Figure 223.\nIts length measured in $K_1$ is its rest length, or proper length, denoted by $l_0$."
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "entry_sha256": "5671ac1aec8297ce7cfb981ce367e6506c47f044d33529575a23a963eef41b77",
          "literal_text": "To measure the moving rod in frame $K$, record both endpoint positions simultaneously according to that frame's synchronized clocks.\nTheir separation is the length $l$ measured in that frame.\nIts relation to the proper length is:"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "entry_sha256": "1d62e5a9c2fd814b6ccca086b84e1b751e10a023e1d4d0504b23a5739aadb54a",
          "literal_text": "$l=l_0\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}$ (8.2)"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "entry_sha256": "e6ad33a3a786f74bab31ce55e4a78cef5c83742d2a84e82e795dd5230ae6e109",
          "literal_text": "For a nonzero relative speed below the speed of light, the contraction factor satisfies:\n$\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}<1$"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "entry_sha256": "9000fe2cd6ced961b9314ccb9f6d52cbb45f51f1439665cf56c111db76e1610f",
          "literal_text": "The moving length along the direction of relative motion is therefore smaller than the same rod's proper length.\nDimensions perpendicular to the relative motion do not undergo this length contraction.\nAt zero relative speed, the measured length equals the proper length."
        }
      ],
      "selected_projection_sha256": "5fb15358891475159f328b0ae7336fc57d9501a29565abf9b002426489d47574"
    }
  },
